  openingText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“There's water flooded in the West Wing. I can hear it dripping through the doors. I'm not a very good swimmer, so I'm going to need a path.”"
  completionText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“It was raining inside the flower. Only a little bit. When it finished, there was a stone at the bottom, blue and cold. I held it the whole way back so I wouldn't drop it in the water.”"
